{"chunk_id":"forgotten_arbiter_general","title":"Ironclad Win Streak Guide: defensive run framework","source_url":"https://gameplay.tips/guides/1855-slay-the-spire.html","source_type":"community_guide","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","character":"IRONCLAD","tags":["ironclad","defense","small_deck","act_1","rest"],"trust":"single_author_strategy","captured_at":"2026-09-28","text":"这是一套社区玩家提出的防御型铁甲战士框架：用可靠格挡和少量高价值攻击提高连续通关稳定性；保持卡组紧凑，避免无条件加入牌；火堆是否休息要结合当前生命和下一段路线，而不是固定每幕休息。它是可检验的软策略，不是硬规则。","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","claim_type":"strategy_heuristic","license":"source terms not reviewed","license_status":"unknown","content_hash":"b27affd608afbbced69783d0b2e25d5bbe033e5351754cd5b7ea512a42171306"}
{"chunk_id":"forgotten_arbiter_upgrades","title":"Ironclad Win Streak Guide: upgrade and removal priorities","source_url":"https://gameplay.tips/guides/1855-slay-the-spire.html","source_type":"community_guide","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","character":"IRONCLAD","tags":["ironclad","upgrade","remove","strike","defend"],"trust":"single_author_strategy","captured_at":"2026-09-28","text":"该指南把删牌、升级和路线视为资源分配问题：优先移除低价值起始牌，但必须结合当前卡组和生存压力；升级优先选择能显著改变出牌效率或当前战斗结果的牌。指南中的具体评级属于作者经验，不能覆盖本机卡牌数据或硬合法性。","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","claim_type":"strategy_heuristic","license":"source terms not reviewed","license_status":"unknown","content_hash":"9cc57d53e64b47f4105d5cc4affa899d715796b3630b309d49c8233ced1d2264"}
{"chunk_id":"panacea_act1_resources","title":"A20 Ironclad Guide: Act 1 resource and HP budget","source_url":"https://gameplay.tips/guides/slay-the-spire-ironclad-guide-high-winrate-ascension-20-heart-killing.html","source_type":"community_guide","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","character":"IRONCLAD","tags":["ironclad","act_1","route","elite","hp_budget","risk"],"trust":"single_source_unverified","captured_at":"2026-09-28","text":"A20 指南强调第一幕要在获得资源和降低死亡风险之间权衡：精英、普通战斗、问号、商店和火堆都可看成有不同生命成本的资源节点。路线选择不能只追求精英数量，要用当前卡组强度、生命、药水和后续路线判断是否承受得起。该内容用于战略上下文，不能替代地图可达性和本地生命约束。","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","claim_type":"strategy_heuristic","license":"source terms not reviewed","license_status":"unknown","content_hash":"a798ed77f6693512995eb3436391237b3eec7b3bee17af6609b032a2878c9e84"}
{"chunk_id":"panacea_tier_list_context","title":"A20 Ironclad Guide: tier lists are conditional","source_url":"https://gameplay.tips/guides/slay-the-spire-ironclad-guide-high-winrate-ascension-20-heart-killing.html","source_type":"community_guide","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","character":"IRONCLAD","tags":["ironclad","card_reward","conditional","act_1","act_2","act_3"],"trust":"single_source_unverified","captured_at":"2026-09-28","text":"该指南明确提醒：卡牌或遗物 tier list 只是选择频率的概括，具体局面、卡组、生命、路线和 Boss 会改变答案。因此候选比较应先解决当前短板，再把流派协同作为软偏好，不能把固定排名直接当作购买或选牌命令。","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","claim_type":"strategy_heuristic","license":"source terms not reviewed","license_status":"unknown","content_hash":"7514af079bc59065297db2936878e434c4296a4bd1d4b24aafb6d9f84608f4f3"}
{"chunk_id":"fantasywarden_pivot","title":"Ironclad Builds: do not force a build","source_url":"https://fantasywarden.com/games/slay-the-spire-ironclad-builds","source_type":"strategy_article","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","character":"IRONCLAD","tags":["ironclad","pivot","adaptive","strength","block","exhaust","hybrid"],"trust":"single_source_unverified","captured_at":"2026-09-28","text":"该文章把力量、格挡、消耗和混合路线作为常见方向，但强调随机奖励下不应在开局强行指定流派，应根据实际获得的牌和遗物调整。力量路线通常需要力量来源与多段或高倍率输出；格挡路线要先有稳定格挡产量再追求转化；消耗路线要同时考虑格挡、抽牌和收尾。","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","claim_type":"strategy_heuristic","license":"source terms not reviewed","license_status":"unknown","content_hash":"bcbc6546a9ec8ae920236c6c7be2d38ed51d1a1ef1350ed30c5dd97a12ba3cd8"}
{"chunk_id":"fantasywarden_exhaust","title":"Ironclad Builds: exhaust engine tradeoffs","source_url":"https://fantasywarden.com/games/slay-the-spire-ironclad-builds","source_type":"strategy_article","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","character":"IRONCLAD","tags":["ironclad","exhaust","corruption","feel_no_pain","dark_embrace","dead_branch"],"trust":"single_source_unverified","captured_at":"2026-09-28","text":"消耗路线的价值来自把消耗转成抽牌、格挡或终结收益；Corruption、Feel No Pain、Dark Embrace 等信号需要结合当前卡组判断。过早消耗会失去控制，因此应检查战斗长度、手牌和后续资源；Dead Branch 等遗物是协同证据而不是单独的强制路线。","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","claim_type":"strategy_heuristic","license":"source terms not reviewed","license_status":"unknown","content_hash":"92b6f46108bbbc06ae31ae52c209501417f47d6be59724ede455041e477e6ef7"}
{"chunk_id":"dood_ironclad_foundation","title":"Ironclad Guide: starter deck and early foundation","source_url":"https://www.dood.gg/en/slay-the-spire/guides/ironclad-guide/","source_type":"strategy_guide","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","character":"IRONCLAD","tags":["ironclad","starter_deck","remove","act_1","damage","block"],"trust":"single_source_unverified","captured_at":"2026-09-28","text":"该指南指出铁甲战士起始牌中有大量低效率填充牌，删牌和用奖励补足早期输出、格挡与运转很重要。第一幕不能只追求后期组件，应先确保能处理普通战斗和精英；这个结构性结论需要与本机卡牌效果和当前生命一起使用。","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","claim_type":"strategy_heuristic","license":"source terms not reviewed","license_status":"unknown","content_hash":"0ba7cc0c74a53b68852491cb5854055b95c88ed83c20d35beb539aaf0992c043"}
{"chunk_id":"dood_barricade_timing","title":"Ironclad Guide: Barricade timing","source_url":"https://www.dood.gg/en/slay-the-spire/guides/ironclad-guide/","source_type":"strategy_guide","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","character":"IRONCLAD","tags":["ironclad","barricade","block","entrench","body_slam","act_1","act_2"],"trust":"single_source_unverified","captured_at":"2026-09-28","text":"格挡堆叠路线要先建立格挡产量，再考虑 Barricade、Entrench 和 Body Slam；高费用或慢速组件在短战斗中可能是负担。即使出现核心牌，也要根据战斗长度、能量、格挡来源和当前威胁决定是否投入。","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","claim_type":"strategy_heuristic","license":"source terms not reviewed","license_status":"unknown","content_hash":"2d6101eb71d2d77eb0a84d6510514198e1324b71aced1fd2a1e1eae8d61969a8"}
{"chunk_id":"sts1_ironclad_strength","title":"Slay the Spire Wiki: Strength","source_url":"https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Strength","source_type":"community_wiki","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","character":"IRONCLAD","claim_type":"mechanic_fact","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0; paraphrased with attribution","tags":["ironclad","mechanic","strength","attack","damage","multi_hit"],"trust":"wiki_mechanics_reference","captured_at":"2026-09-29","prerequisites":["当前角色与敌人的力量数值可从结构化状态读取"],"exceptions":["每次攻击的基础伤害、命中次数及虚弱/易伤等修正仍需独立计算","不得仅凭力量事实强制锁定力量流派"],"text":"《杀戮尖塔》第一部中，力量会修正攻击伤害；多段攻击的每次命中都需要把当前力量纳入计算。该事实可辅助比较战斗结果和攻击成长，但不代表应无条件围绕力量构筑。","license_status":"verified","content_hash":"f8624f307d91b77d2406186f077f19b96e16e42c573b8bf34781affa090f766d"}
{"chunk_id":"sts1_ironclad_vulnerable","title":"Slay the Spire Wiki: Vulnerable","source_url":"https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Vulnerable","source_type":"community_wiki","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","character":"IRONCLAD","claim_type":"mechanic_fact","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0; paraphrased with attribution","tags":["ironclad","mechanic","vulnerable","attack","damage"],"trust":"wiki_mechanics_reference","captured_at":"2026-09-29","prerequisites":["目标易伤层数或状态已由当前游戏状态确认"],"exceptions":["易伤修正针对攻击伤害，不应直接套用于非攻击伤害","额外遗物与游戏版本差异需要由本机数据确认"],"text":"《杀戮尖塔》第一部中，易伤单位受到的攻击伤害提高 50%。战斗比较仍需同时考虑攻击基础伤害、力量、虚弱、命中次数和其他已确认修正。","license_status":"verified","content_hash":"a099fd4105f0ba438815f69e0e9695bcee11c54c81147281722259bdaacb69e0"}
{"chunk_id":"sts1_ironclad_weak","title":"Slay the Spire Wiki: Weak","source_url":"https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Weak","source_type":"community_wiki","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","character":"IRONCLAD","claim_type":"mechanic_fact","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0; paraphrased with attribution","tags":["ironclad","mechanic","weak","attack","damage"],"trust":"wiki_mechanics_reference","captured_at":"2026-09-29","prerequisites":["攻击者虚弱状态已由当前游戏状态确认"],"exceptions":["虚弱修正针对攻击伤害；力量、易伤和多段攻击语义仍需分别处理","遗物或版本修正应以本机数据为准"],"text":"《杀戮尖塔》第一部中，虚弱会使受影响角色造成的攻击伤害降低 25%。该修正仅作为已确认攻击效果的一项输入，不能代替完整的目标与伤害计算。","license_status":"verified","content_hash":"eaad4e33b6cc6e88c7ecc764025c31427f04e716d9f8e561408ffc7211932c97"}
{"chunk_id":"sts1_burning_blood","title":"Slay the Spire Wiki: Burning Blood","source_url":"https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Burning_Blood","source_type":"community_wiki","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","character":"IRONCLAD","claim_type":"mechanic_fact","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0; paraphrased with attribution","tags":["ironclad","mechanic","burning_blood","relic","heal","hp","combat"],"trust":"wiki_mechanics_reference","captured_at":"2026-09-29","prerequisites":["确认角色仍装备初始遗物 Burning Blood"],"exceptions":["回复发生在战斗结束后，不增加战斗内格挡或当前回合生命","替换/移除初始遗物后不再假定该回复"],"text":"铁甲战士的初始遗物 Burning Blood 在战斗结束时回复 6 点生命。它影响战斗后的资源预算；除非当前状态确认遗物仍在，否则不能把这项回复计入计划。","license_status":"verified","content_hash":"d86ba83e48e58079f558bb672519ea398c1aeeb360386fcdbab6dfb172399682"}
{"chunk_id":"sts1_strength_multihit_synergy","title":"Derived strategy heuristic: Strength and multi-hit attacks","source_url":"https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Strength","source_type":"community_wiki","game_version":"Slay the Spire 1","game_id":"slay-the-spire-1","character":"IRONCLAD","claim_type":"strategy_heuristic","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0; paraphrased with attribution","license_status":"verified","tags":["ironclad","strength","multi_hit","attack","synergy"],"trust":"mechanic_derived_heuristic","captured_at":"2026-09-29","prerequisites":["本回合存在可用的力量来源与多段攻击候选"],"exceptions":["实际收益还要结合基础伤害、命中数、费用、力量获得时点、目标易伤/虚弱和战斗长度","该结论是由力量逐击修正推出的比较启发，不是实战胜率标签"],"text":"力量会增加每次攻击命中的伤害，因此在其他条件相近时，已有力量可提高多段攻击的相对价值。将其作为比较力量来源与多段攻击的协同信号；按实际费用、基础伤害、命中次数和时机计算，不据此锁定路线或声称收益必然更高。","content_hash":"2a60fe902f4ea4a8b4b76ef0b362f92825984bd7d62b5be89f89071c33cd4cc9"}
